  "rationale": "Use a minimal plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in small deterministic specifications. The policy gives random_walk in clear exploration, inserts a short move_forward phase for coverage, forces obstacle-triggered turn recovery, and uses full_rotate only as a last-resort blocked-front escape after repeated front blocks. Uncontrollable events are total in every specification state, and action/commit states self-loop on non-critical path_clear to respect pre-action sensor processing while allowing obstacle events to preempt for safety.",
